{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>WARNING: This video game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blasfemia</strong> is a first-person horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a seemingly normal apartment but realize early on that you're not alone. Explore a handcrafted, detail rich environment in a tense and terrifying atmosphere and try to find a way out before an ominous entity gets to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/86a501638c0a45f958fa0e9b708c40e9.webp?t=1770602028\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in an apartment in which a tragedy unfolded. Learn more about the people who lived here as you progress and beware of the sinister entity slowly growing it's presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/260709e486eb229aca89f981c4fb7450.poster.avif?t=1770602028\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/260709e486eb229aca89f981c4fb7450.webm?t=1770602028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/260709e486eb229aca89f981c4fb7450.mp4?t=1770602028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way out before it's too late. The many secrets these walls hold are the answer to your situation or the next step towards your demise? As a player, we expect you'll use your investigative wits to uncover the truth and decide your destiny for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/608dd715fdf6dc2910eccb0c08b68be2.poster.avif?t=1770602028\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/608dd715fdf6dc2910eccb0c08b68be2.webm?t=1770602028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/608dd715fdf6dc2910eccb0c08b68be2.mp4?t=1770602028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/3612d8af0700dac43e1e9942946ac933.webp?t=1770602028\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>defenseless</strong>. There are no weapons to find. The entity grows stronger  and could be lurking at any corner, waiting to strike. The only way to beat it is by outsmarting it. You'll be able to pick up items, interact with the environment and solve puzzles. Each step or action you make could be taking you closer to your salvation... Or to your very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/7eaaefd870cc2fdedf85abd3deb18e67.poster.avif?t=1770602028\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/7eaaefd870cc2fdedf85abd3deb18e67.webm?t=1770602028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699970/extras/7eaaefd870cc2fdedf85abd3deb18e67.mp4?t=1770602028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stage 1: Infestation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/ce31ce6928113bef0e7dcce89619694c0abf60bc.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 2: Oppression","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/77ff793dc61119f6ca8b68c9f0dac410969c74f4.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 3: Possession","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/154e2083dee9a4c90fda48c0020ba6b1f4ccec51.jpg"},{"name":"A very unique Duck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/720d833c3dc9ffcfc6aefdc1f65fd6e3ad4f7c1d.jpg"},{"name":"The First Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/874f20528c71a0967cd04f091c56759632bbcf19.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/7e5349915985989ace7e37fe4c63cf8befeac640.jpg"},{"name":"I Remember Now...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/f45b4c186bf6e47a51ec305d8752a2c26886d62f.jpg"},{"name":"I Want a Real Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/78c15a8f17d09a349ea9a5a78db53b610fb820ae.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/cedb815d72f4dcf04bc5e5d93589bebe3476397e.jpg"},{"name":"True Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699970/0a9e3e69e04102bbd6bd05968cd45c3bf2d105a1.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699970?t=1770602028","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app